1
00:00:08,659 --> 00:00:10,939
So far it's mostly cold asphalt.

2
00:00:19,278 --> 00:00:21,878
Riveting footage of an oncoming minivan.

3
00:00:29,896 --> 00:00:31,999
Even the telephone pole looks chilly.

4
00:00:35,950 --> 00:00:37,510
Brace for the downtown.

5
00:00:56,577 --> 00:00:58,777
That's just normal pedestrians.

6
00:01:05,950 --> 00:01:07,767
Trolley taking its time.

7
00:01:11,295 --> 00:01:17,175
Silverado, where the wildest gamble in town is wondering if this traffic light will ever turn green.

8
00:01:22,403 --> 00:01:24,466
A squad car patrolling the void.

9
00:01:34,750 --> 00:01:36,870
Rugged camper creeping through.

10
00:01:40,017 --> 00:01:42,377
Behold, the entire parade.

11
00:01:59,950 --> 00:02:02,150
Such selfless public service.

12
00:02:07,150 --> 00:02:08,630
And down goes the camera.

13
00:02:16,080 --> 00:02:18,040
Hard to slow down from a crawl.

14
00:02:26,699 --> 00:02:29,407
Very *brisk* display of parked sedans.

15
00:02:37,317 --> 00:02:40,100
Careful, that twenty-seven might ignite the pavement.

16
00:02:47,936 --> 00:02:50,039
Where the historic tension peaks.

17
00:02:58,554 --> 00:03:01,262
Ah yes, the dreaded *murder murdering*.

18
00:03:09,173 --> 00:03:11,953
And a firm grasp on local folklore.

19
00:03:19,791 --> 00:03:21,511
Tough room for pocket eights.

20
00:03:30,409 --> 00:03:32,583
A very formal legal defense.

21
00:03:41,028 --> 00:03:43,468
Scenic bench facing the mud patches.

22
00:03:51,646 --> 00:03:53,891
Thirty-one, slow down you madman.

23
00:04:02,265 --> 00:04:04,545
Deadwood Tourism Board wants a word.

24
00:04:12,883 --> 00:04:16,203
Speed limit thirty-five. Uncharted territory.

25
00:04:23,502 --> 00:04:26,102
Escaping downtown at a furious crawl.

26
00:04:37,150 --> 00:04:39,097
As opposed to *earlier*?

27
00:04:49,924 --> 00:04:49,948
Surviving the Deadwood rush.
